===Noun===
{{en-noun|iconostases}}

# {{lb|en|Eastern Orthodoxy}} A wall of [[icon]]s between the [[sanctuary]] and the [[nave]] in an [[Eastern Orthodox]] [[church]].
#* {{quote-book|year=1932|author=[[w:Maurice Baring|Maurice Baring]]
|title=Friday's Business
|chapter=10|url=http://openlibrary.org/works/OL45537W
|passage=The altar was hidden behind an '''Iconostasis'''. The church was looked after by an old sacristan who lived in a cottage on the shore of the lake.}}

